    intro: 'Color contrast ratio measures the luminance difference between a foreground (text) color and a background color. WCAG 2.1 requires a minimum 4.5:1 for normal text (AA) and 7:1 for AAA. This tool calculates the exact ratio and shows pass/fail status for both standards instantly as you type.',
