    h1: 'AI Token Cost Calculator — Compare API Pricing for GPT, Claude & Gemini',
    intro: 'AI API costs are charged per token — roughly 4 characters or 0.75 words. Pricing varies by a factor of 1,000× across models: Gemini 1.5 Flash costs $0.075 per million input tokens while Claude Opus 4 costs $15/M. This calculator computes exact per-request, daily, and monthly costs for 13 major models including GPT-4o, Claude, Gemini, Llama, and Mistral.',
