    slug: 'churn-rate-calculator',
    title: 'Churn Rate Impact Calculator',
    tagline: 'See how monthly churn compounds into revenue loss over 12 months.',
    category: 'saas',
    tier: 3,
    color: '#f26b4e',
    lightColor: '#fff1ee',
    metaTitle: 'Churn Rate Calculator — Free SaaS Churn Impact Tool Online',
    metaDescription: 'Calculate how monthly churn rate compounds into 12-month revenue loss. See MRR erosion, customer count, and what reducing churn by 1% saves. Free, no login.',
    keywords: ['churn rate calculator', 'saas churn calculator free', 'customer churn calculator', 'monthly churn rate calculator', 'revenue churn calculator', 'churn impact calculator'],
    h1: 'Free Churn Rate Calculator — SaaS Revenue Loss from Customer Churn',
    intro: 'Churn rate is the percentage of customers who cancel their subscription in a given period. Even a seemingly small monthly churn of 5% compounds to a 46% annual customer loss. This calculator shows the MRR erosion and total revenue impact of your current churn rate over 12 months, and what improving churn by 1% saves.',
